WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
Liang Qiuxue, why don’t you wear those very expensive grooming clothes?

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:06,300
Since you marry a rich man, you have to dress up and wear brand-name products. Otherwise, you should adjust the price more.

3
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,060
This is not a class reunion

4
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,820
I'm not too out of place either.

5
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:14,260
So I only wear customized clothes worth the down payment of your new house.

6
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:15,660
Sure enough, you used too much force

7
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,160
Does it seem too low-key?

8
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,500
How did you know I bought a house?

9
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,160
I accidentally found out that Roujia was not here.

10
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:23,890
sorry sorry

11
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:24,830
i'm late

12
00:00:24,830 --> 00:00:27,200
There's a traffic jam on the road

13
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,760
Liang Qiuxue, long time no see

14
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:30,060
you are still so beautiful

15
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:31,160
This is my fare to the next life

16
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,850
Just give me double

17
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:33,950
Even if she wants reimbursement

18
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:35,750
You shouldn't do it in front of so many classmates, right?

19
00:00:35,750 --> 00:00:36,950
Although I am not short of money

20
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:39,950
But looking at Roujia, who once suppressed her, she looks like this now

21
00:00:39,950 --> 00:00:41,550
why am i not happy at all

22
00:00:41,550 --> 00:00:45,050
I just said she lost money. She is really poor and crazy. What's the matter with you?

23
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:46,850
Losing money for less than thirty yuan

24
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:47,950
How poor do you have to be?

25
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:50,350
The down payment was all borrowed from No. 5 Wall classmates.

26
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:52,050
I will reimburse you and place your order first.
